while 2020 might have been a relatively  light year for superhero movies  2021 looks to be a return to form there  are a slew of superhero flicks scheduled  to hit cinemas or at least some  streaming service playing the role of a  theater  and we have everything you need to know  about these upcoming blockbusters  sony dropped the first trailer for  morbius in january 2020  and it was met with a mixture of  confusion and excitement  the three-minute clip is essentially a  mini origin story for lesser-known  marvel anti-hero dr michael morbius  a brilliant scientist who turns to  vampirism after his attempts to cure his  red blood disease have mixed results  he gets super strength and hyper speed  but he's also left with  naturally even overpowering urge to  consume  blood morbius debuted as an enemy of  peter parker in 1971's amazing  spider-man issue 101  but he became more of a sympathetic  figure in later issues while his  loyalties aren't revealed in the trailer  we do  see him meeting with an established  villain interestingly michael keaton  shows up at the end of the trailer  looking a lot like adrian toombs aka the  vulture  keaton's character is seen in the same  white prison jumpsuit  he was wearing in the spider-man  homecoming post credits whether this  means that morbius will be directly  tying into the mcu by way of spider-man  homecoming  remains to be seen fans are predicting  that morbius will sow the seeds for a  big screen sinister six  while matt smith's luxurious crown aka  hunger is clearly the big bad  you'll get the chance to see it for  yourself when mobius comes out march  19th  2021 after years of teasing marvel  finally announced that a standalone  black widow movie  was coming dropping the news at comic  con 2019. by the end of the year we had  our first teaser for the film  a prequel that takes place after the  events of captain america  civil war after siding with steve rogers  during the dispute over the sokovia  course natasha romanov will be operating  under the radar in black  widow the first entry in phase four of  the mcu  making a mcu debut in black widow is  florence pew as helena belova  another product of the red room the  notorious training facility with which  romanov clearly hasn't finished business  the trailers have also given us a good  look at the movie's big bad taskmaster  as well as ramona's family from her time  in training rachel vice is playing  melina vostakov  and david harbour is a slightly out of  shape alexis shostakov aka the red  guardian he's essentially the russian  captain america the next entry in the  mcu film franchise will be released may  7th  2021 while tom hardy will be back as  eddie brock aka venom  director reuben fleischer will not be  returning for the sequel  taking over for him will be black  panther antagonist andy circus  circus made his directorial debut in  2017  with heartwarming drama brief and he  proved his blockbuster chops the  following year with mowgli legend of the  jungle the venom mid credits scene made  it clear that sony was plotting a sequel  and woody harrelson will be starring in  venom 2 as carnage to make good on his  creepy promise  when i get out of here and i will  there's gonna be carnage  what form that carnage will take even  harrelson doesn't know he says he quote  just rolled the dice on venom two  without seeing the script  you'll get a chance to see all the  karnas you could want on june 25th  2021 according to the hollywood reporter  marvel's goal for shanghi and the legend  of the ten rings is to offer quote  a perspective on asian identity the  studio has hired asian and asian  american filmmakers  to make sure that happens and judging by  the character's history that's a smart  move  the hands of shang chi master of kung fu  comics began as an unofficial  continuation of bruce lee's legacy  with a character that was obviously  based on the martial arts icon while  marvel's intentions may have been noble  the execution wasn't always perfect the  job of bringing  shang qi into the modern age belongs to  chinese american screenwriter dave  callahan  and japanese hawaiian director destin  daniel cretan  the titular role has gone to chinese  canadian actor simu liu who may be best  known for his appearances in the sitcom  kim's convenience crazy rich asian star  or kwafina will also feature  though her role has yet to be revealed  there's not a lot of details out about  the upcoming film  but is aiming for a july 9 2021 release  date  one of the highlights of dc fandom was a  role call for james guns the suicide  squad  which officially introduced the ensemble  cast of the soft reboot  biola davis joel kinnaman margot robbie  and jai courtney reprise their roles  from 2016's suicide squad  and they'll be joined by a host of new  recruits the director is clearly excited  about his anti-hero team-up flick  he promised that it will be quote  different from every other superhero  movie ever made and called the filming  experience the greatest most exciting  journey of his life to date  the featurette release during dc's  fandom revealed that plenty of big  action set pieces are in store when the  film arrives on august 6th  2021 but there's a catch the suicide  squad will hit theaters and hbo max at  the same time  so you can relax at home and catch the  flick or venture out into the wild and  do the same  marvel's upcoming eternals movie isn't  due to hit cineplexes until the end of  2021  but the film has already entered  production there's nothing concrete in  terms of plot but we do know that this  will be one of marvel's most eclectic  ensembles to date  angelina jolie leads a pact cast that  includes kit harrington  gemma chan kumayo nanjiani salma hayek  brian tyree henry barry keuin and more  the screenplay comes by way of matthew  and ryan furbo  while indie filmmaker chloe zhao has  been chosen to helm this huge cosmic  feature you won't have to wait an  eternity to see this movie it'll arrive  in theaters on november 5th  2021 work on tom holland's third  standalone spider-man movie  began in earnest when sony and disney  reached a new agreement  over the character rights in september  2019 but like countless other projects  it was delayed due to the coronavirus  pandemic the still entitled sequel to  spider-man far from home  has been pushed back to december 2021.  john watts director of holland's first  two spider-man solo outings  is expected to see out the trilogy and  far from home co-writers chris mckenna  and eric summers are penning the  three-core plot details still remain  scarce  but there's been some big casting news  in a move that nobody saw coming  marvel is bringing back jamie foxx as  electro the character he portrayed in  the andrew garfield led the amazing  spider-man 2.  it's a truly shocking reveal fans  already suspected that marvel was slowly  building to an on-screen sinister six  and the return of electro only  strengthens that theory and how is it  that holland spider-man will be coming  into contact with characters from other  spider verses  well the announcement in october 2020  that benedict cumberbatch will appear in  the film as doctor strange  might offer a clue either way the as yet  untitled film will swing into theaters  on december 17th  2021 check out one of our newest videos  right here plus even more looper videos  about your favorite comic book movies  are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one
 

